Nov. 30, 1790
	Smythers died today after battling madness brought on by his wounds. I fear my time is soon at hand, as well.

Dec. 3, 1790
	Irony of ironies! I was discovered by the very people I came to this island to discover. Scouts of the Ashlag tribe found me hovering near death and brought me to their camp, where they helped me to recover. Contrary to what I believed, they reside in the interior of the island, and not along the coast. The most shocking part of this is that there was a previous civilization on this island! The Ashlag have made their home amongst the ruins of some great, forgotten civilization.}

